{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cozy oldschool adventure where you explore a magical map, one tile at a time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide Lapin, a curious bunny girl, through a patchwork world of strange events, tough decisions, and stat-driven surprises. With every new board, you\u2019ll face forks in the path\u2014and the outcomes are anything but predictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you thrive on luck, logic, or sheer bunny stubbornness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game is a self-contained journey, full of colour, stats-based gambles, and little stories. Play again and again to uncover new tiles, write new stories, and let the bunny girl explore more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/TenfoldTales_FeatureDivider1A.png?t=1743793106\" /><br>Discover a 100-tile board one space at a time \u2014 each run reshuffles the map and the fate ahead.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/TenfoldTales_FeatureDivider1B.png?t=1743793106\" /><br><br><br>\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0<br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/TenfoldTales_FeatureDivider2A.png?t=1743793106\" /><br><br>Outcomes depend on your strengths, earlier choices and a little bit of luck<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640130/extras/TenfoldTales_FeatureDivider2B.png?t=1743793106\" /><br><br>\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0+_+\u00b0\u00b0